name: sim.addStatusbarMessage
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.addStatusbarMessage(string message)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. message: message. Will clear the status bar if message is nullptr. If message has an "@html" suffix, then the statusbar will correctly interpret html font color tags, e.g.:
2. <font color="#F00">Hello</font> World!@html
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
